{'symbol': 'GM', 'date': '2022-01-05 13:00:00', 'title': 'PURE WATERCRAFT UNVEILS NEW ELECTRIC PONTOON BOAT', 'text': "LAS VEGAS, JAN. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PURE WATERCRAFT, A LEADING MANUFACTURER OF ELECTRIC BOATS AND PROPULSION SYSTEMS, TODAY UNVEILED ITS GROUNDBREAKING ALL-ELECTRIC PONTOON BOAT AT CES AND OPENED PRE-ORDERS ON ITS WEB SITE.\xa0 THIS IS THE FIRST PRODUCT TO RESULT FROM PURE WATERCRAFT'S COLLABORATION WITH GENERAL MOTORS (NYSE: GM)."}